Title: Collie Kart Portable P006.3a

Summary: MK7 PASS-THROUGH ONLY input hook and checked-read safety preflight

Description: |
    P006.3a validates real-device game-frame interception with no
    artificial input. The original MK7 controller processing always runs.
    Read-checked pad inspection, atomic callback telemetry and READY-off
    hook uninstall reduce risk; P006.2 remains the tested fallback.
    It does NOT drive, inject buttons, or train an AI.
    Hook safety and USA Rev2 compatibility remain hardware-UNVERIFIED.

Compatibility: Any

MemorySize: 5MiB

UsePrivateMemory: false
